  "abstract": "Capacity sweep around best LN-SSM: proj_rank p=34 (vs. 32/36). Same loss (MAE+curvature \u03bb=1e-4) and V-OrthoReg (\u03bb=1e-5), LN after gating, a_max=0.993, \u03b3_end=0.99.",
